		font-size: 0.95rem;
		letter-spacing: 0.1em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		color: #d3d9e3;
		border: 1px dashed rgb(233 238 245 / 0.4);
		clip-path: polygon(12px 0, 100% 0, calc(100% - 12px) 100%, 0 100%);
